                <pb facs="0653" n="1307" sameAs="frus:frus1875v02/pg1307"/>

                <head>No. 633.<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Maynard to Mr. Fish</hi>.</head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Constantinople</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1875-08-16"><hi rendition="#italic">August</hi> 16, 1875</date>.
                        (Received August 16.)</dateline></opener>
                <p rendition="#flush"><hi rendition="#small-caps">Fish</hi>, Washington:</p>
                <p>Saturday, Porte, informed by Aristarchi, telegraphed governor, ordering
                    reparation made American consul before Hartford reaches Tripoli.</p>
                <closer><signed>MAYNARD.</signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
